## Third-Party Data & Services

This project relies on external data sources and services that carry their own
terms:

- **Map tiles & data — OpenStreetMap.** Map imagery and geographic data are
  © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database License
  (ODbL). See https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright.
- **Overpass API.** Building footprint queries use the public Overpass API,
  a shared community resource subject to its fair-use policy.
  See https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Overpass_API.
- **Nominatim.** Address/place search uses the public Nominatim geocoding
  service, subject to its usage policy (identify your app, max ~1 request/sec,
  no heavy bulk/autocomplete traffic).
  See https://operations.osmfoundation.org/policies/nominatim/.

The MIT license above applies to this project's own source code, not to the
third-party data/services it consumes.
